$ORIGIN example.com.
$TTL 300
@       300  IN  A     192.0.2.1
www     300  IN  A     192.0.2.10
api     60   IN  A     192.0.2.20
mail    3600 IN  MX    10 inbound-smtp.example.com.
_sip._tcp 300 IN SRV   10 60 5060 sipserver.example.com.
@       300  IN  TXT   "v=spf1 include:_spf.example.com ~all"
blog    300  IN  CNAME www.example.com.
@       3600 IN  CAA   0 issue "amazon.com"
